dominant_flow: browser page/component (apps/web/src/app/**) → TanStack Query hook (apps/web/src/hooks/**) → axios client (apps/web/src/services/api/**) → NestJS *.controller.ts (apps/api/src/api/**) → *.facade.service.ts → services/*.service.ts → repositories/*.repository.ts → drizzle-orm → MySQL, with DTO types flowing back through packages/shared.
structure: web routes in apps/web/src/app/** with components defaulting to app/**/_components/; API domains in apps/api/src/api/{boffmedia,smartrotom,auth,wingull,battlesimulator,mail}/<feature>/; drizzle tables in apps/api/src/_db/schema/<Domain>.ts; i18n JSON in apps/web/locales/{es,en}/; MCEF bridge in apps/web/src/services/mcef/.
layers[6]{layer,surface,convention}:
  web-route,apps/web/src/app/**,"Next.js App Router; Spanish route segments; route groups in parens ((boffmedia), (herramientas), smartrotom/<app>); new components default to the route's own _components/ folder"
  web-data,"apps/web/src/hooks/<domain>/useX.ts + apps/web/src/services/api/{boffmedia,smartrotom,tools}/","TWO coexisting styles: Boffmedia uses a TanStack hook wrapping an axios *Service.ts; many SmartRotom apps instead keep queries in their own app/smartrotom/<app>/_hooks/queries.ts calling rotomPOSTOrThrow (apps/web/src/services/http/rotom-client.ts) with inline route strings. Components never fetch inline; MCEF calls go through mcefQuery<T>() in services/mcef/mcefApi.ts"
  controller,apps/api/src/api/**/<feature>.controller.ts,"NestJS @Controller with @ApiTags/@ApiOperation swagger decorators and per-route guards (JwtAuthGuard/RolesGuard/OwnerOrAdminGuard); delegates to an injected *FacadeService; only DTOs/entities cross the boundary. Example: apps/api/src/api/boffmedia/events/events.controller.ts"
  dto,apps/api/src/api/**/dto/*.dto.ts,"one file per operation; class-validator + class-transformer decorators plus @ApiProperty so generate:shared can emit the client model; non-GET /smartrotom/* bodies extend BaseDto. Example: create-event.dto.ts"
  service,"apps/api/src/api/**/<feature>.facade.service.ts + <feature>/services/*.service.ts","two-tier: a facade orchestrates domain-scoped collaborator services. Example: events.facade.service.ts wiring EventsService/GamesService/AchievementsService/TeamsService. A service touching DRIZZLE directly must carry a verbatim // LEGACY_DIRECT_DB marker"
  data,"apps/api/src/api/**/repositories/*.repository.ts (legacy shared: apps/api/src/api/_repositories/boffmedia/)","@Injectable class injecting @Inject(DRIZZLE) db: MySql2Database, querying schema objects with drizzle operators (eq/and/isNull/alias); the only layer allowed unmarked DRIZZLE access per scripts/check-layering.mjs. Example: apps/api/src/api/boffmedia/events/repositories/events.repository.ts"
